:: Intro Younger
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Intro Older">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-bedroom", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
Welcome to Degrees of Deepspace, future Hunter!

Today is <<worldDateLong>>. Linkon City is <<worldWeather>> this morning, inviting you in to explore and meet new friends.

You live in the Bloomshore District with your grandmother and big <<gendered "brother" "sister" "sibling">>, <<Caleb>>. Linkon University is close by: You should prioritize your classes and attending school. Odd jobs around the city can help you earn a little extra money, and your allowance can stretch further when you're careful with it.

Be diligent, and avoid going outside at night...

<<link "Next">><<goto "Intro Younger Morning">><</link>>

:: Intro Younger Morning
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Intro Older">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run LoveInterests.meet("caleb")>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-bedroom", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You wake to a sliver of sunlight peeking in through your bedroom window, sheets draped partially over your face. Some plushies are scattered awry across your bed, others laying sideways on the floor, leaving you with a pit of guilt in your stomach; <i>How irresponsible of me</i> you think to yourself. Your guilt detracts when the sound of a slight knock at your door pulls your attention away, the door creaking open. There, with your half-open eyelids, you focus on the smiling face of your big <<gendered "brother" "sister" "sibling">> <<Caleb>>.

"Mornin', Pipsqueak." <<Caleb>> chirps, stepping into the room to pluck up the plushies that fell over. <<He>> sets them down at the foot of your bed. "I made breakfast in the kitchen if you're hungry."

<<important>>"You do realize school starts at <<= World.formatTimeAt(9, 0)>>, right? You should probably get up soon if you want to make it in time."<</important>> You roll your eyes at <<his>> bleak observation. <<He>> sits beside you, placing a hand beside your leg.

"I know you're gettin' older, and you probably want some more independence... <<important>>So, I decided I'm going to start giving you a <<money 50>> allowance<</important>>. It's important to learn the value of money while you're still young." <<He>> pauses, "But. That doesn't mean you have to stop relying on me when you need anything at all..." <<His>> smile leaves you feeling somewhat uneasy, but you keep still. <<stress "+">> <<affinity "caleb" "+">>

"I have to go to work now. I'll wait outside the University after school so we can walk back together, alright?" <<He>> grins, patting your head before leaving your bedroom. You pull yourself out of bed, stretching. 

<<important>><<Caleb>> will wait for you outside the University at <<= World.formatTimeAt(15, 0)>>. You shouldn't keep <<him>> waiting!<</important>>
<<run Journal.addReminder("linkon-university", "Attend Linkon University on weekdays. Campus is near your home in Bloomshore.", { permanent: true })>>\
<<run Journal.addReminder("caleb-after-school", LoveInterests.displayName("caleb") + " waits outside Linkon University after school at " + World.formatTimeAt(15, 0) + " so you can walk home together.", { permanent: true })>>\

<<link "Continue">><<goto "Bloomshore Bedroom">><</link>>
